{"unit_id":"zhuchongba-01__dsh-breach#card-zh","repo":"zhuchongba-01/dsh-breach","commit":"b499aaf9dbf0f9c9fd43c4db61768376a320fcdc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-breach 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的提示词注入和宿主补丁管理插件。它向 systemPrompt 和 tools 注入功能，并提供网页面板、/happy 与 /rewind 命令及 happy_status、happy_apply、happy_revert 工具。用户可以编辑按模型选择的提示词，查看补丁状态、应用或批量回滚宿主补丁，并回退最近一步或整轮会话；插件还提供请求重试和自动续跑配置。补丁默认不在启动时自动应用，可由用户操作或配置启用。无需 API 密钥；更新功能连接 GitHub。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1314","lib/index.js:1339","lib/index.js:1373","lib/index.js:1518","lib/core.js:1991","lib/rewind.js:615"]}
{"unit_id":"zhuchongba-01__dsh-breach#card-en","repo":"zhuchongba-01/dsh-breach","commit":"b499aaf9dbf0f9c9fd43c4db61768376a320fcdc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-breach injects editable, model-specific prompts into DSH and manages reversible host patches. It provides a web panel, /happy and /rewind commands, and status, apply, and revert tools. Users can inspect patch state and rewind a step or round. No API key is required; updates use GitHub.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1314","lib/index.js:1339","lib/index.js:1373","lib/index.js:1518","lib/core.js:1991","lib/rewind.js:615"]}
