{"unit_id":"zhuchongba-01__dsh-breach#feature-1","repo":"zhuchongba-01/dsh-breach","commit":"b499aaf9dbf0f9c9fd43c4db61768376a320fcdc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-breach 的功能「提示词注入」：把当前编辑内容、DSH_HOME 下的 prompt-inject.md 或内置默认提示词用于提示词注入，并支持按模型绑定不同提示词。由插件加载及提示词组装钩子触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:346","lib/index.js:1318"]}
